# Iron rule: confirm before delete

Any control that **deletes or permanently removes** user data must ask first (`Alert.alert` with ยกเลิก + destructive ลบ). Never delete on the first tap.

Applies to: messages, photos in chat, conversations, reminders, favorites, products, media, variants, stickers, tracks.

```ts
// ❌ BAD
onPress={() => deleteMessage(id)}

// ✅ GOOD
onPress={() => {
  Alert.alert('ลบข้อความนี้?', 'ข้อความจะถูกเอาออก', [
    { text: 'ยกเลิก', style: 'cancel' },
    { text: 'ลบ', style: 'destructive', onPress: () => deleteMessage(id) },
  ]);
}}
```

Do not add a second confirm if the caller already showed one. Undo/eraser/clear-canvas tools are not deletes.
